Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:08.83,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Isaac Westcott...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.91,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What on earth are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:14.17,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What is you desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.05,0:00:17.37,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What do you even keep doing this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:04.69,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I was only ten when I first became \Naware of what kind of person I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.21,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It was my mother's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:12.37,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I lamented the death of my kind mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:13.77,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:17.73,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I felt more elation than sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:21.59,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,The grief and despair filling that place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:26.89,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,brought me joy and excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:33.02,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Apparently my sensibilities are rather \Ndifferent from a normal person's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:41.05,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Though I've lived my life careful \Nnot to let others learn about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:48.33,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Not even my closest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.17,0:03:05.74,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,I told you, straining that hard \Nwon't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:10.58,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Calm your emotions, and do it \Nlike you're gently touching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:15.21,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,I'll show you one more time, so watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:33.23,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Go on, once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:34.97,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:42.78,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Look, I just said...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:44.37,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Elliot, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.05,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,So this is where you've been?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:49.96,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:51.01,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:53.76,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,As you can see, we're practicing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:58.12,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Ellen is still struggling \Nto get the knack for it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:04:01.53,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,But I just can't do it that well!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:05.94,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,Elliot, you and Ike are both able to \Nuse magic even better than the adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:07.64,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.22,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Karen can do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:13.15,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,I wonder how there can be \Nsuch a difference between sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.37,0:04:15.58,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:16.97,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,That was bad of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:18.52,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Ahh, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.18,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's all right, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:25.96,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'll help you too,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:28.07,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,so let's all head to the training grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:32.54,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,If we practice outside we'll get yelled at \Nby the teachers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:36.35,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,The adults are all scaredy-cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:42.05,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,No outsiders would ever choose \Nto come to such a remote place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:44.29,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,They have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:48.31,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Magi like us have always been \Npersecuted for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:51.95,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Especially during our parents' \Nand teachers' generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.55,0:04:56.53,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Back then we were always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.27,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Ellen, Elliot, me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:02.27,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,and Ellen's little sister, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:07.77,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Even so, I think they're being too fearful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:12.36,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,The teachers would never lose \Na fight against a normal person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:14.78,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Not as long as they came in small numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:18.89,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,But it would be a different story \Nif it was one against a hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:20.52,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,or one against a thousand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:22.88,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:26.00,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,People fear that which is different from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:29.35,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,And that fear gives rise \Nto violence and madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:34.39,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Keeping our true nature hidden \Nis the most virtuous thing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:39.40,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,I don't really understand \Nwhat you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.68,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,Our village...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:52.13,Flashback,Karen,0,0,0,,Sister, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:54.66,Flashback,Karen,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:58.97,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Elliot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:00.78,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,You can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:02.22,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:07.23,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,What we have to do right now \Nis protect Ellen and Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:29.25,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,At some point I began to long for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:32.45,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,even greater elation than \Nmy mother's death brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.55,0:06:38.23,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,And in that moment \NI also felt joy close to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.45,0:06:44.87,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Along with a survivor's sadness \Nand despair over those who died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:49.81,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Elliot, Ellen, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:52.49,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Let's create a world for magi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:57.27,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Let's banish humanity and create \Na world exclusively for us magi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:00.59,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,They were the ones who started this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.44,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,So there's no reason we shouldn't do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:06.29,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,I won't forgive them...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:07.82,Flashback,Karen,0,0,0,,Not ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:12.32,Flashback - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Thank you for granting me \Nthis opportunity to exact vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:14.70,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,I'll avenge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:18.83,Flashback - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Thank you for granting me \Nthis opportunity to exact vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.25,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,From today onward,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.94,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,we're the only allies we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:25.34,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,The entire world is our enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:26.70,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:29.34,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Let's recreate this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:37.77,Flashback - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.81,Flashback - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,for making me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:43.48,Flashback - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:51.10,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Afterwards, the four of us took shelter \Ntemporarily in the city's orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:55.09,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Of course we kept our origins hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:07:59.72,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Roughly three years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:02.74,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I was adopted by a wealthy couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:07.15,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Eventually they met \N"an unfortunate accident" and died,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:10.45,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,leaving their wealth to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:19.02,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I called Elliot, Ellen, and Karen to my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.49,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,and we dedicated ourselves \Nto researching magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:28.99,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,All to uncover a way to exact vengeance \Non this world and everyone in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.73,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Then the day finally came.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:44.67,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Karen, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:45.89,Flashback,Karen,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:59.51,Flashback,Ellen,0,0,0,,Ike, this Spirit Formula...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.51,0:09:02.47,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Yes, it will create a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:08.44,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,It'll gather all the mana in the world into \Na single point and create a brand new lifeform.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:13.78,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Along with a brand new world \Nthat covers this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:17.26,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,A Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:21.81,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,An omnipotent space where someone \Ncan make whatever they imagine a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:24.68,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,If my calculations are correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.93,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,the space possessed \Nby the Spirit born from this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:31.73,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,should be large enough to cover all of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:36.22,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,It'll be large enough \Nto call a Neighboring World,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:39.29,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,a world that borders our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:42.27,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,That will be our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:47.34,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,We'll overwrite this world \Nwith the Neighboring World.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:54.31,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,I predict there will be \Na shock wave when the Spirit manifests.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:57.89,Flashback,Westcott,0,0,0,,Elliot, prepare the protective wards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:58.73,Flashback,Woodman,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:41.39,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,You seem slightly different than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:45.45,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Perhaps you've recalled the fact \Nthat I killed you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:49.02,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,when you were Shinji Takamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.27,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:52.50,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Seems I hit the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:57.59,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I had anticipated that once \NDeus revealed herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:12:00.19,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,but once again I'm reminded
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:03.89,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,that power is truly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:07.62,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Though this puts me in a troublesome spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:11.93,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'm happy that Deus has shown herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:17.25,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,but in my current state it would be \Nimpossible for me to absorb her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:21.70,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,So, Shido Itsuka,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.73,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,in order to reach her,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:29.63,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'll be claiming the Spirit power \Nyou possess first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:30.93,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.73,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:40.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:41.53,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.19,0:12:43.28,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:47.83,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Let's get started, Magus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:53.14,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'll finish this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:56.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I won't even grant you time \Nto steel your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:06.18,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:10.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,This space is already under \Nthe dominion of Ein Sof Ohr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:13.85,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Without any spirit power or magic power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:16.55,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,you'll only be wasting \Nyour lives in this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:26.57,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:37.03,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.41,0:13:38.96,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:40.96,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:44.68,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Kaguya...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:51.77,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yuzuru... Kaguya...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:59.10,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's two down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:00.36,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.94,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You're a bit troublesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:05.36,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,so I wanted to save you for last...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:15.44,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.52,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Mukuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:18.46,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Thanks, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:20.96,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Tohka?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:24.09,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Tohka, where are Kaguya and Yuzuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:37.40,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,So that's the Spirit of Origin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:40.48,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Hmph, she has a nasty air about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:44.36,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ahh, it's been so long, Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:45.98,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:50.15,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I have to retrieve my Sephirah right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:53.41,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,But there's no need for you to die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:54.99,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You should back away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.06,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:02.95,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,If I take this too slow, then Shin will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So I'll end this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:11.85,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,That light's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:15.05,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Elliot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:26.78,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hey. You awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:37.70,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I think we can say I won, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:40.91,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:41.81,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:45.83,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Like you said, you've won, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:50.42,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,I can't afford to live in shame any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:08.48,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Elliot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.41,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:13.18,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Rendering your enemy powerless \Nis a natural thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:17.33,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous \Nto let you keep that Realizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:20.20,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:22.40,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Why won't you kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:24.99,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,The loser doesn't get to order \Nthe winner around, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:27.76,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,How dare you call me a dummy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:29.09,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,You need to quit acting ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.93,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I'm not being ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:33.12,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,It's my choice whether to kill you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.50,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,That's what I mean by being ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:37.37,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make fun of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.37,0:16:39.60,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,That's why I called you a dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.37,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Why are you always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:47.69,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,You've always made fun of me \Nand treated me like a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:50.74,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Even in this situation \Nyou're showing me kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:55.11,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Why won't you recognize me \Nas your enemy?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:57.38,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:58.99,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Be quiet for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:08.86,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Why didn't you take me with you, Elliot?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:22.86,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hit my limit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:25.95,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Well, that came sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:31.02,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I thought I would have time \Nto see Karen once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:35.63,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Karen, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:38.59,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:41.07,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Sorry, boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:43.11,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,but it looks like this is it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:45.43,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:49.54,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,How pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:00.10,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein Sof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:20.82,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,What on earth is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:22.07,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,A territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.03,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:26.83,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You're not mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:34.18,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,DEM used this as a model \Nto develop their territory technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:39.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,However, this territory of mine \Nis constantly deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:44.35,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It lies just one thin membrane \Noutside of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:50.67,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,And I've currently summoned \Na portion of its core, Ein Sof, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:57.81,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Which means the space surrounding me \Nis now the Neighboring World.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.81,0:18:59.24,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Neighboring World?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:04.11,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind \Nof power this Ein Sof holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:07.50,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,However, that won't matter \Nas long as we stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:09.83,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Michael, Segva!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:11.00,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:16.88,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:20.45,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Michael has the ability \Nto seal any and all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:24.71,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's not impossible to seal \Nthe power of Ein Sof with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:28.22,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I can't blame you for reaching that judgment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:33.01,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,but this is the Neighboring World \Nencroaching on this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:34.53,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:40.79,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,All of its rules and natural laws \Nare different from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:47.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Attacking Ein Sof in here \Nis set to "impossible".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:50.36,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:55.04,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,In this world, everything is as I will it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:19:59.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's three down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.17,0:20:01.59,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,We're running!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:07.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,As expected, Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Good judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.35,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:16.56,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll make it so none in this world \Nare able to escape it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:21.24,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,You added more rules?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:24.49,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Tsk, so anything goes then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:26.34,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:29.49,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Everything in this world obeys my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:30.58,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:36.81,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Mana, I've caused you trouble for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.35,0:20:38.25,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:50.61,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.51,0:20:53.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Have you remembered for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:58.94,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Wait just a little bit, \NI'm sure Shin will need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.97,0:21:03.70,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.20,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.16,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:14.87,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:18.75,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:23.88,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Hmm, then I'll forbid that, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:25.26,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:29.60,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:49.49,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Four down.
