Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs18\pos(604,310)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 7 "The World Tree Sheds Leaves"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.09,0:23:28.52,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Shido faces off against Westcott.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:32.39,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the Spirits are driven \Ninto a life-or-death crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:36.18,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next time is Episode 7: \N"The World Tree Sheds Leaves."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.53,0:23:39.14,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Behold the ultimate finishing move.
